WEBVTT

1
00:00.300 --> 00:05.200
Magpie lets you borrow SOL against tokens you already hold — without selling them.

2
00:08.570 --> 00:14.690
This is magpie.capital. Three collateral classes: memecoins, tokenized stocks & RWAs, and collectibles.

3
00:14.890 --> 00:23.300
Hit Dashboard and connect your wallet. Everything lives in one place.

4
00:23.700 --> 00:28.000
Balances, eligible collateral, active loans, and your credit score — all live.

5
00:28.400 --> 00:31.800
A live loan: 7.7 SOL against WIF. Now watch this.

6
00:32.100 --> 00:41.080
The V4 ladder: at $2.60, 25% sells automatically — in-vault. At $3.20, another 25%. At $4.65, the rest. A stop-loss guards the downside.

7
00:41.380 --> 00:50.320
That's the innovation: tokens catch random green candles. Take the loan, spend the SOL — and never miss a candle. You never leave the market.

8
00:50.620 --> 00:53.500
Repay any time — collateral back, credit built.

9
00:54.100 --> 01:02.700
Prefer chat? The Telegram bot does everything the dashboard does — borrow, extend, repay — right from your phone.

10
01:03.600 --> 01:09.400
Collateral that can still sell itself. Start today at magpie.capital.
